flowchart LR
    %% Dashed nodes are planned by the voice assistant plan (V1-V3).
    User[User: text or hold-to-talk voice] --> Mobile[React mobile app: result list, optional voice reply]
    Mobile <--> API[Python FastAPI backend: auth, sessions, central config]
    API <--> Speech[Deepgram speech: STT and TTS, key on backend]
    API <--> LLM[LLM step: tidy query, grounded summary; Ollama then Workers AI profiles]
    API --> Search[Hybrid search: live and archive in parallel, merged list]
    Search --> GitHub[GitHub Search API]
    Search --> Milvus[(Milvus 365-day archive + SQLite catalogue)]
    Public[Public GitHub repositories: permissive, pushed in 365 days] --> Worker[Ingestion worker: capped backfill, weekly refresh, sweeps]
    Worker --> Embed[README and metadata chunks, E5 embeddings]
    Embed --> Milvus
